  "2026-10-22T15:06:06.504Z",codex-agent,"Final local round acceptance: npm run release:check and bun run release:check each pass 209/209 source tests plus 3/3 packed npm/Bun acceptance tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations, first attempt with no timeout or retry. Both report 100/100/100/100 coverage on 25 files, zero duplication (5368 lines, 51 sources), 75 documented declarations and zero production vulnerabilities. Dist is ignored and rebuilt. Exact focused/proof commands, results and retained-claim recovery semantics are documented in docs/fenced-leases-verification.md. Fresh remote/review data confirms main is already contained, the same two valid unresolved threads, full comment pagination and no outside-diff findings; no further instance remains. Existing follow-ups remain open; no new PM CLI/SDK bug observed. Release claim without closing the item. Commit code and append-only tracker evidence together, then verify complete exact-head CI before handoff."
